@sylvioalves I suppose this problem is related to all socs in esp32 family. 

The problem is that app access the flash as it is configured in quad spi mode, but it is actually in dual spi mode. In our application flash_read will always read 0xFF.

Calling `bootloader_enable_qio_mode` on application startup before mapping flash segments and modifying linker script to link the function in ram solved this issue for me, but since this function is intended to be used only by bootloader I don't think this is a proper solution.
